Package: rpackit
Title: Check and Package R Applications
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Inspects R application projects and the local build environment
    before packaging. It recognizes common Shiny layouts, plans dependencies
    from parsed R source, package metadata, and lockfiles, validates exact
    dependency sources and version constraints, resolves verified portable R
    runtimes, prepares atomic desktop resource bundles, manages loopback Shiny
    processes, and recommends portable desktop, static web, and dynamic server
    targets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://rpackit.github.io/rpackit/,
    https://github.com/rpackit/rpackit
BugReports: https://github.com/rpackit/rpackit/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
